, "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked, and both reservations are confirmed:\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight was available, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge in New York, $189/night for 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, for $378. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, only the flight had gone through. So I booked the hotel by itself instead of resending the whole trip, which would have risked booking the flight twice. As a result, there are two separate reservations instead of one combined booking. There are no duplicate bookings or extra charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01F2Kdt1CFDqs2d5oZeWeEey", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QFoT4QuzQq2dno9e1L6qXW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Dv1f23Rc5z8FMvGh156g2G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01FzxAGht6oMkJUT374Y82Vv"